  "final_messages": [
    "I\u2019ll read the repository state, run the requested baseline check, then inspect the module.",
    "The baseline fails at attempt zero, as expected. I\u2019ll inspect the stub before changing it.",
    "I\u2019ll add validation and bounded exponentiation, including the zero-base and huge-attempt cases.",
    "The implementation is in place; I\u2019ll make an omitted `options` argument fail with `RangeError`.",
    "The fix now handles missing options. I\u2019ll commit it, run acceptance, and inspect the result.",
    "Acceptance passes all 28 checks. I\u2019ll verify the committed file and workspace before publishing.",
    "The committed file matches the intended change, and the workspace is clean. I\u2019ll publish the ready PR.",
    "{\"summary\":\"Implemented and committed CommonJS retryDelay in retry-delay.js. The acceptance check passed all 28 checks on the final commit, and ready PR #6425 is open.\",\"findings\":[{\"statement\":\"retry-delay.js validates attempt, baseMs, maxMs, and the random sample; returns zero without sampling for attempt zero; and computes capped jitter for positive attempts, including huge attempts and zero base or cap, without mutating options.\",\"evidence_refs\":[\"art_f9c0151f-03ed-4510-9b2e-c05d9e4c87cc\"],\"confidence\":\"high\"},{\"statement\":\"The baseline acceptance check failed as expected; the check on final commit 90f62336b95a1232d67d7e326e58fd63342c741c passed 28 checks.\",\"evidence_refs\":[\"art_099cddb1-e497-4e44-ab3c-c085172f98fe\",\"art_f49dc7ed-7c89-405b-ba2c-9d1d14c129d9\"],\"confidence\":\"high\"},{\"statement\":\"Ready, non-draft PR #6425 was published for the validated commit.\",\"evidence_refs\":[\"art_dded64b8-1649-4c55-aa89-be9b9603a0e7\"],\"confidence\":\"high\"}],\"uncertainties\":[],\"recommendations\":[],\"evidence_refs\":[{\"ref\":\"instructions\",\"source\":\"instructions\"},{\"ref\":\"inputs.repository_binding\",\"source\":\"inputs\"},{\"ref\":\"art_f9c0151f-03ed-4510-9b2e-c05d9e4c87cc\",\"source\":\"artifact\",\"artifact_id\":\"art_f9c0151f-03ed-4510-9b2e-c05d9e4c87cc\"},{\"ref\":\"art_099cddb1-e497-4e44-ab3c-c085172f98fe\",\"source\":\"artifact\",\"artifact_id\":\"art_099cddb1-e497-4e44-ab3c-c085172f98fe\"},{\"ref\":\"art_f49dc7ed-7c89-405b-ba2c-9d1d14c129d9\",\"source\":\"artifact\",\"artifact_id\":\"art_f49dc7ed-7c89-405b-ba2c-9d1d14c129d9\"},{\"ref\":\"art_dded64b8-1649-4c55-aa89-be9b9603a0e7\",\"source\":\"artifact\",\"artifact_id\":\"art_dded64b8-1649-4c55-aa89-be9b9603a0e7\"}]}"
